WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:19.622
Mother ran outside when Jack came home.

2
00:00:19.623 --> 00:00:23.219
She was happy to see Jack without the cow.

3
00:00:23.220 --> 00:00:29.234
"Wonderful!" Mother cried. "You sold Milky White!

4
00:00:29.235 --> 00:00:32.575
How much money did you get?

5
00:00:32.576 --> 00:00:38.285
Ten gold coins? Twenty gold coins?"

6
00:00:38.286 --> 00:00:43.669
"Um . . . " Jack gulped. "Er . . . "

7
00:00:43.670 --> 00:00:46.162
He put on his brightest smile.

8
00:00:46.163 --> 00:00:54.323
"I got something better than money, Mother."

9
00:00:54.324 --> 00:00:59.109
Jack reached into his pocket.

10
00:00:59.110 --> 00:01:03.936
"I traded Milky White for five magic beans."

11
00:01:03.937 --> 00:01:08.286
He opened his hand and showed Mother the beans.

12
00:01:08.287 --> 00:01:12.757
"What?" Mother gasped and turned pale.

13
00:01:12.758 --> 00:01:18.463
For a moment she said nothing.

14
00:01:18.464 --> 00:01:21.986
Then she dropped to the ground.

15
00:01:21.987 --> 00:01:25.684
"Beans?" Mother's hand was on her heart.

16
00:01:25.685 --> 00:01:33.725
"You traded Milky White for . . . beans?"

17
00:01:33.726 --> 00:01:36.687
"Don't cry, Mother!" Jack begged.

18
00:01:36.688 --> 00:01:39.970
"Please! Don't cry!"

19
00:01:39.971 --> 00:01:43.909
But tears were streaming from Mother's eyes.

20
00:01:43.910 --> 00:01:47.487
"They are magic beans," Jack said again.

21
00:01:47.488 --> 00:01:49.219
"We can plant them.

22
00:01:49.220 --> 00:01:55.453
A giant beanstalk will grow—as high as the sky!"

23
00:01:55.454 --> 00:02:01.096
"Oh, Jack!" Mother sobbed.

24
00:02:01.097 --> 00:02:03.244
"You're a clever boy.

25
00:02:03.245 --> 00:02:07.223
But sometimes you do silly things.

26
00:02:07.224 --> 00:02:22.005
We need money, not beans!"

27
00:02:22.006 --> 00:02:23.937
Jack tried again.

28
00:02:23.938 --> 00:02:27.375
"Didn't you hear me, Mother?" he said.

29
00:02:27.376 --> 00:02:30.092
"The beans are magic."

30
00:02:30.093 --> 00:02:32.852
Mother shook her head in anger.

31
00:02:32.853 --> 00:02:35.654
"Jack, listen to me.

32
00:02:35.655 --> 00:02:37.914
Beans are beans.

33
00:02:37.915 --> 00:02:44.069
They are not magic!"

